{"id":"ae97979446fbacc2","group":"56","path":"56/56-prop-outermost-restriction-preserves-normal-forms.md","title":"最外限制保持正规形","display":"prop-outermost-restriction-preserves-normal-forms — 最外限制保持正规形","type":"proposition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"proposition","label":"56-prop-outermost-restriction-preserves-normal-forms","aliases":["56-prop-outermost-restriction-preserves-normal-forms"],"display":"prop-outermost-restriction-preserves-normal-forms — 最外限制保持正规形","depends_on":["[[56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]","[[56-df-position]]"],"source_section":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.5(iii–iv); §9.1 Definition 9.1.1","source_printed_pages":"131,478–479","source_ocr_blocks":[152,499,500],"source_verification":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-prop-outermost-restriction-preserves-normal-forms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-prop-outermost-restriction-preserves-normal-forms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-outermost-restriction-preserves-normal-forms — 最外限制保持正规形"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" href=\"?note=e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" title=\"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation\">56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.5(iii–iv); §9.1 Definition 9.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131,478–479"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span><span>499</span><span>500</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" href=\"?note=e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" title=\"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation\">56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OuterPos}\">\\(\\operatorname{OuterPos}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}\">\\(\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" href=\"?note=e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" title=\"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation\">56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation</a>；有限位置集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalForms}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalForms}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}\\subseteq\\to_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}\\subseteq\\to_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R},t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,t)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R},t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,t)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalForms}(T,\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R})\n=\\mathrm{NormalForms}(T,\\to_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NormalForms}(T,\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R})\n=\\mathrm{NormalForms}(T,\\to_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：子关系包含显然。若t有任意红项，有限非空红项位置集中取长度最短的p；它上方没有红项，所以p最外，按其匹配见证可作一个最外步。因此最外子关系不会额外产生正规形。这里保留的只是正规形集合，没有证明最外关系本身正规化；不公平地选择某一最外红项仍可能错过正规形。来源给出策略应保持正规形的要求；本命题是对本目录位置表示的直接证明。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60","anchor":"ref-1","targetA